## CSS 压缩

### cssnano

```javascript
// postcss.config.js
export default {
  plugins: {
    cssnano: {
      preset: [
        'default',
        {
          discardComments: { removeAll: true },
          normalizeWhitespace: true,
          colormin: true,
          reduceIdents: true,
          mergeRules: true,
          minifyFontValues: true,
          minifyGradients: true,
          minifySelectors: true,
        },
      ],
    },
  },
};
```

```css
/* 压缩前 */
.container {
  margin-top: 10px;
  margin-right: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  margin-left: 20px;
  color: #ff0000;
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  font-weight: bold;
}

/* 压缩后 */
.container {
  margin: 10px 20px;
  color: red;
  background-color: #000c;
  font-weight: 700;
}
```

### Lightning CSS

Lightning CSS 是用 Rust 编写的 CSS 解析和压缩工具，速度远超 cssnano：

```typescript
// Vite 中使用 Lightning CSS
import { defineConfig } from 'vite';

export default defineConfig({
  css: {
    transformer: 'lightningcss',
    lightningcss: {
      targets: { chrome: 95 },
      drafts: { customMedia: true },
    },
  },
  build: {
    cssMinify: 'lightningcss',
  },
});
```

